{
  "DSH 正在运行时无法更新，而更新前的版本也已经损坏。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，退出 DSH 后重新安装即可。": "DSH cannot be updated while it is running, and the pre-update version is corrupted. To avoid getting stuck on the next launch, the market removes it from the profile. The plugin directory is still in place, just exit DSH and reinstall.",
  "取消时，旧版本已被清掉一部分。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，重新安装即可；若再次失败，先退出 DSH 再装。": "When cancelled, the old version was partially cleared. To avoid getting stuck on the next launch, the market removes it from the profile. The plugin directory is still in place, just reinstall it; if it fails again, exit DSH and install it again.",
  "GitHub token（仅本次会话内存，刷新后需重新输入；留空则使用服务端 DSH_GITHUB_TOKEN 或已登录的 gh CLI）": "GitHub token (only the memory of this session needs to be re-entered after refreshing; leave blank to use the server DSH_GITHUB_token or the logged-in gh CLI)",
  "将删除：市场的停用清单与自定义分组，以及它写进配置文件的停用记录——被停用的插件将恢复运行。不涉及密码或密钥，市场从不把它们存在磁盘上。": "Will delete: the deactivation list of the market with the custom grouping, and the deactivation record it writes to the profile - the deactivated plugin will resume operation. There are no passwords or keys involved, and the market never stores them on disk.",
  "评论来自 GitHub Discussions。打开后会连接 giscus.app 与 GitHub；发表评论需要 GitHub 账号。": "Comment from GitHub Discussions. Opening it will connect giscus.app to GitHub; a GitHub account is required to leave a comment.",
  "有 Agent 正在运行，请等它完成或先取消，再更新——更新会直接替换插件文件，运行中的 Agent 可能中途报错或新旧版本混用。": "There is an agent running, please wait for it to complete or cancel before updating - the update will directly replace the plugin file. The running agent may report errors or mix old and new versions.",
  "当前会话已被占用，可能是其他正在运行的 DSH 导致的（如其他 dsh web、桌面端），请退出其他正在运行的 DSH 后重试。": "This session is already in use, possibly by another running DSH instance (such as another dsh web or the desktop app). Quit the other DSH instances and try again.",
  "已安装，但不是最新版：这个 profile 的 minimumReleaseAge 挡住了 {0}，安装的是 {1}。": "Installed, but not the latest version: This profile's minimumReleaseAge blocks {0}, installing {1}.",
  "npm 近30天滚动下载量：{0}。这不是累计下载量，也不代表独立用户数。统计可能延迟，来源核验时间不保证数据完整。": "npm rolling downloads in the last 30 days: {0}. This is not a cumulative download and does not represent the number of unique users. Statistics may be delayed, and the source verification time does not guarantee the completeness of the data.",
  "当前 dsh 进程正被调试器连接。请从 IDE 或终端停止该进程后重新启动，市场不能从界面里结束正在调试的 dsh。": "The current dsh process is being connected by the debugger. Please restart the process after stopping it from the IDE or terminal, the market cannot end the dsh being debugged from the interface.",
  "在这里登录会离开本页，返回时需重新打开 dsh web——这不是故障。发表评论请到 GitHub，本页只用于阅读。": "Logging in here will leave this page, and you will need to reopen the dsh web when you return - this is not a glitch. Leave a comment on GitHub, this page is for reading only.",
  "有 Agent 正在运行，请等它完成或先取消，再安装——安装会改动插件文件，运行中的 Agent 可能中途报错。": "There is an Agent running, please wait for it to complete or cancel before installing--Installation will change the plugin file, and the running Agent may report errors halfway.",
  "这些目录不被任何插件使用，也不影响启动，是更新中断后留下的。退出 DSH 后可以删除，或重新安装对应的插件。": "These directories are not used by any plugins and do not affect startup, they are left after the update is interrupted. After exiting DSH, you can remove or reinstall the corresponding plugin.",
  "另一个安装、更新或卸载还在进行，现在还不能开始：这一条留在队列里，等它完成后会自动开始，不需要再点一次。": "Another installation, update or uninstallation is still in progress and cannot be started yet: this one stays in the queue and will start automatically once it is completed, no need to click again.",
  "本次重启没有成功，dsh 已经退出。勾选你希望下次启动时启用的插件；本次启动报错的插件已标红并取消勾选。": "This reboot was unsuccessful and dsh has exited. Check the plugin that you want to enable the next time you start; the plugin that reported an error on this startup has been red and unchecked.",
  "这一条要装的插件在当前目录里找不到了（目录刷新过或换了页），已从队列移除。请在目录里重新找到它再装一次。": "This plugin to be installed cannot be found in the current directory (the directory has been refreshed or changed pages), it has been removed from the queue. Please find it again in the catalog and install it again.",
  "cordis 不接受重复的条目 id，保留它会让 DeepSeek Harness 下次启动失败。": "cordis does not accept duplicate entry ids, keeping it will cause DeepSeek Harness to fail the next time it starts.",
  "插件把 DSH 自带的公共包列进了依赖，可能和 DSH 自己的版本互相干扰（仅依据声明，未确认）：": "The plugin lists the public packages that come with DSH as dependencies, which may interfere with DSH's own version (by declaration only, unconfirmed):",
  "等待 DeepSeek Harness 启动超时。可点「调整插件」，检查是否某个插件导致无法启动。": "Timeout waiting for DeepSeek Harness to start. Click \"Adjust Plugin\" to check if a plugin cannot be started.",
  "请帮我修复 DeepSeek Harness 的插件问题（profile：{0}）。诊断发现如下：": "Please help me fix a plugin issue for DeepSeek Harness (profile: {0}). The diagnostic findings are as follows:",
  "已下载完成。重启 DeepSeek Harness 后新版本才会生效——页面会先显示新版本号。": "Download complete. Restart DeepSeek Harness to activate the update.",
  "精选目录里有同名插件，但与你本地仓库不一致，无法安全恢复。可以卸载本地版，或继续用本地开发。": "There is a plugin with the same name in the featured directory, but it does not match your local repository and cannot be safely recovered. You can uninstall the local version or continue with local development.",
  "该插件需要运行构建脚本才能工作，出于安全考虑已默认阻止。确认来源可信后，可放行并重新安装：": "The plugin requires a build script to run in order to work and has been blocked by default for security reasons. Once the source is verified, it can be released and reinstalled:",
  "把当前的插件顺序和已停用的插件保存为组合，随时切换；应用前会先试启动一次并自动创建快照。": "Save the current plugin order and deactivated plugins as a combination and switch at any time; try to launch it once and automatically create a snapshot before applying.",
  "WebDAV 地址与用户名仅保存在当前浏览器；密码只存于服务端，每次会话需重新输入。": "The WebDAV address and username are only saved in the current browser; the password is only stored on the server side and needs to be re-entered each session.",
  "还没有收藏。在「发现」或「主题」里点书签图标，或在「已安装」的「···」里加入收藏。": "No favorites yet. Tap the bookmark icon in Discover or Themes, or add a collection to Installed.",
  "保留市场数据。注意：被市场停用的插件会保持停用，且移除后将没有界面可将其重新启用。": "Keep market data. Note: Plugins that are deactivated by the market will remain deactivated and there will be no interface to re-enable them once removed.",
  "将诊断问题交由新对话中的 Agent 修复（内容已复制到剪贴板，由你决定是否发送）": "Refer the diagnostic issue to the Agent in the new conversation for repair (the content has been copied to the clipboard and you decide whether to send it or not)",
  "目录记录的 npm 版本；目录每日刷新，可能滞后于 npm 上的实际 latest": "The npm version of the directory record; the directory is refreshed daily and may lag behind the actual latest on npm",
  "全选 = 完整备份（含配置文件）；否则只导出勾选的插件，可另勾「包含配置文件」。": "Select All = Full backup (including configuration files); otherwise, only checked plug-ins can be exported, and \"Include configuration files\" can be checked separately.",
  "安装来源是另一台电脑上的本地路径，本机找不到。请重新安装该插件，或改为本机路径": "The installation source is a local path on another computer, which the machine cannot find. Please reinstall the plugin or change to the native path",
  "已卸载，但 pnpm 在收尾阶段报错（通常是文件被占用）；配置已同步，无需重试": "Uninstalled, but pnpm reported an error at the closing stage (usually the file is occupied); the configuration is synchronized, no need to retry",
  "精选目录里没有这个插件，无法恢复到线上版本。可以卸载本地版，或继续用本地开发。": "This plugin is not available in the featured directory and cannot be restored to the online version. You can uninstall the local version or continue with local development.",
  "仅包含插件清单和 profile 配置，不含插件文件；恢复时按清单重新安装。": "Only the plugin manifest and profile configuration are included, no plugin files are included; reinstall according to the manifest when restoring.",
  "日志已导出：dsh-market-log.txt，请将其附在 issue 中": "Log exported: dsh-market-log.txt, please attach it to issue",
  "目录（{0} 刷新）记录的 npm 版本；之后发布的版本要等下次刷新才会出现": "The npm version of the directory ({0} refresh) record; subsequent releases will not appear until the next refresh",
  "社区 bundle 加载顺序与插件声明的 before/after 规则冲突": "The community bundle loading order conflicts with the before/after rules declared by the plugin",
  "GitHub 认证失败：Token 无效、已过期，或 gh CLI 未登录": "GitHub authentication failed: Token is invalid, expired, or gh CLI is not logged in",
  "该顺序会改变组合：{0} 处覆盖、{1} 个无效条目、{2} 个重复条目": "This order changes the combination: {0} overrides, {1} invalid entries, {2} duplicate entries",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动卸载（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "Agent is busy, queued, and uninstalled automatically when idle (can be canceled in Tasks in the top right corner).",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动安装（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "The agent is busy, queued, and automatically installed when it is free (can be canceled in the \"Tasks\" in the top right corner).",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动更新（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "The agent is busy, queued, and will automatically update when it is free (can be canceled in the \"Tasks\" in the top right corner).",
  "回滚会用快照覆盖当前的插件与配置，且不可撤销（可先创建新快照再回滚）。": "Rollbacks overwrite the current plugin and configuration with a snapshot and are irreversible (you can create a new snapshot before rolling back).",
  "正在重启：dsh 启动后本页会刷新；若又失败，会带着新的报错回到这里。": "Restarting: This page will refresh after dsh starts; if it fails again, it will return here with a new error report.",
  "由环境变量 DSHM_GITHUB_PROXY 管理，界面中不可修改。": "Managed by DSHM_GITHUB_PROXY environment variable.",
  "下面标红的插件在本次启动时报了错，取消勾选后下次启动不再启用它们。": "The plugins marked red below reported an error on this startup, and they will not be enabled on the next startup after unchecking them.",
  "重启方式：关闭当前 dsh 进程后重新运行（例如 dsh web）": "Restart method: Run again after closing the current dsh process (e.g. dsh web)",
  "将卸载本地版本并安装线上版本，之后照常检查更新。此操作无法撤销。": "The local version will be uninstalled and the online version will be installed, after which the update will be checked as usual. This action cannot be undone.",
  "已按 DSH {0} 筛选；未声明或无法确认兼容性的插件仍会显示": "Filtered by DSH {0}; undeclared or incompatible plugins will still show",
  "恢复将覆盖当前 profile 配置并重新安装插件，确定继续吗？": "Restoring will overwrite the current profile configuration and reinstall the plugin, are you sure you want to continue?",
  "正在检查宿主要求 {0}/{1}；未声明或无法确认的插件仍会显示": "Checking host requirements {0}/{1}; undeclared or unconfirmed plugins will still be displayed",
  "该 npm 包可能由其他人发布，并非同一插件；确认可信后再继续。": "The npm package may be published by someone else and is not the same plugin; confirm it is trusted before proceeding.",
  "一组只有一个主题。选择不会启用它，更换会把原来的主题移出该组。": "A group has only one subject. Choosing not to enable it and replacing it will move the original topic out of the group.",
  "应用变更前会自动创建快照；也可手动创建，随时回滚到任意状态。": "Snapshots are automatically created before changes are applied, or they can be created manually and rolled back to any state at any time.",
  "排队时它还在已安装列表里，现在已不在，因此跳过（没有卸载）。": "It was still in the installed list at the time of queuing and is no longer there, so it was skipped (not uninstalled).",
  "从这个 profile 卸载市场。已装的其它插件不受影响。": "Uninstall the market from this profile. Other installed plugins are not affected.",
  "本页检查插件冲突、依赖版本不匹配与加载顺序问题。常用术语：": "This page checks for plugin conflicts, dependency version mismatches, and loading order issues. Common terms:",
  "检测到兼容性风险，建议重启前到诊断页处理，或回滚本次操作。": "Compatibility risk detected, it is recommended to go to the diagnostics page before restarting, or roll back this operation.",
  "静态扫描只能证明「有」，不能证明「没有」。这不代表它安全。": "A static scan can only prove yes, not no. This does not mean it is safe.",
  "SKILL.md 需包含 YAML 格式的技能名称和描述": "SKILL.md must include YAML name and description",
  "下列插件的界面文件已损坏，刷新后页面可能空白，建议回滚：": "The interface files of the following plugins are corrupted. After refreshing, the page may be blank. It is recommended to roll back:",
  "加载顺序 = 插件被激活的先后，后加载者可能覆盖先加载者": "Loading order = the order in which the plugin is activated, the last loader may override the first loader",
  "发现社区为 DeepSeek Harness 开发的插件": "Discover plugins developed by the community for DeepSeek Harness",
  "可以更新到 {version}：它声明兼容当前 DSH。": "Can update to {version}: it declares compatibility with the current DSH.",
  "已从发现页移出。在「已安装」后面的「已屏蔽」里可以取消。": "Moved out of the discovery page. You can cancel in Blocked after Installed.",
  "建议顺序（按 before/after 规则自动排序）：": "Suggested order (automatically sorted by before/after rule):",
  "此操作后，同一个插件名出现在两处，重启后只有一个会生效：": "After this operation, the same plugin name appears in two places, and only one will take effect after restart:",
  "首次安装需下载插件的依赖包，大型插件可能需 1-3 分钟": "The first installation requires the download of the plugin dependency package, large plugins may take 1-3 minutes",
  "Gist ID 或链接（导出留空则新建私有 Gist）": "Gist ID or link (leave the export blank to create a new private Gist)",
  "新增 {added} 个，移除 {removed} 个": "Added {added}, removed {removed}",
  "日志没有指出具体插件，下面按启用状态列出可调整的插件。": "The log does not indicate a specific plug-in, the list of adjustable plug-ins is shown below by activation status.",
  "更新模式需要 Gist ID：请填写，或切换为「新建」": "Update mode requires Gist ID: please fill in, or switch to \"New\"",
  "项变更需重启 DeepSeek Harness 后生效": "Item changes will take effect after DeepSeek Harness is restarted",
  "也可能让 DeepSeek Harness 起不来。": "It may also make DeepSeek Harness unable to get up.",
  "可以装 {version}：它声明兼容当前 DSH。": "Can be loaded with {version}: it declares compatibility with the current DSH.",
  "提前获取待验证版本，可能不稳定。仅影响插件市场自身。": "Getting the pending version in advance may be unstable. Affects only the plugin market itself.",
  "收藏功能暂不可用。请刷新页面或重启 dsh web。": "Favorites is temporarily unavailable. Please refresh the page or restart dsh web.",
  "重启 DeepSeek Harness 后完全清理。": "Clean up completely after restarting DeepSeek Harness.",
  "恢复完成，请重启 DeepSeek Harness": "Recovery complete, please restart DeepSeek Harness",
  "支持 .zip、技能文件夹或单个 SKILL.md": "Supports .zip, a skill folder, or single SKILL.md",
  "确定要卸载插件市场吗？卸载后需使用命令行重新安装。": "Are you sure you want to uninstall the plugin marketplace? It needs to be reinstalled using the command line after uninstallation.",
  "中国大陆访问更快。仅改变下载线路，插件来源不变。": "Faster in China. Only changes CDN routing; source is identical.",
  "另一个安装、更新或卸载还在进行，请等它完成后再试": "Another installation, update or uninstallation is still in progress, please wait for it to complete and try again",
  "替换未完成。下列插件已卸载且未恢复，请重新安装：": "Replacement incomplete. The following plugins have been uninstalled and not restored, please reinstall:",
  "等待 DeepSeek Harness 启动超时": "Timeout waiting for DeepSeek Harness to start",
  "自动配置失败。请导出日志并附在 issue 中。": "Autoconfiguration failed. Please export the log and attach it to the issue.",
  "/{command} 不接受附件，请先移除附件": "/{command} does not accept attachments; remove them first",
  "bundle = 一个插件包，会按顺序叠加加载": "bundle = A plugin package that is stacked sequentially",
